msgstr "Opt-in-Modus"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:303
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:323
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:211
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:255
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:326
msgid "Single opt-in"
msgstr "Einfaches Opt-in"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:306
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:327
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:212
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:256
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:327
msgid "Double opt-in"
msgstr "Double Opt-in"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:310
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:219
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:200
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:330
msgid ""
"Single opt-in subscribes the user immediately. Double opt-in sends a "
"confirmation email; the subscription is only completed once the user clicks "
"the link."
msgstr ""
"Beim einfachen Opt-in wird der Nutzer sofort abonniert. Beim Double Opt-in "
"wird eine Bestätigungs-E-Mail gesendet; die Anmeldung ist erst "
"abgeschlossen, wenn der Nutzer auf den Link klickt."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:316
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:201
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:302
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:366
