msgstr "E-Mail-Feld"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:321
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:344
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:370
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:396
msgid "Add a field to the form template to enable Newsman."
msgstr ""
"Fügen Sie ein Feld zur Formularvorlage hinzu, um Newsman zu aktivieren."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:332
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:369
msgid ""
"The selected field provides the subscriber email. Any field type may be used "
"(text, tel, url, email, …)."
msgstr ""
"Das ausgewählte Feld liefert die Abonnenten-E-Mail. Jeder Feldtyp kann "
"verwendet werden (text, tel, url, email, …)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:339
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:202
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:312
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:384
