msgstr "Vornamen-Feld"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:358
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:387
msgid ""
"Optional. When set, the field value is sent as the subscriber's firstname "
"instead of being included in the subscriber properties."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Wenn gesetzt, wird der Feldwert als Vorname des Abonnenten "
"gesendet, statt in die Abonnenten-Eigenschaften aufgenommen zu werden."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:365
